{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8356","id":5251237861,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABOP-H5Q","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8356","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8356.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/8356.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8356","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8356/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/8356/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8356/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/19b2f4408e6e41f58054fe0242f4c2012f9e467d","number":8356,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(id): persist server-config provisioning into live serving state (#5119 slice 3)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Slice 3 of #5119 (queue task 14074): startup provisioning now lands in the live serving state instead of a throwaway in-memory value.\n\n## What changed\n- `groups::log::GroupLog::record_preformed` — records an already-formed event keeping its ID and chain place; an event whose ID the log already holds is skipped, so seeding is a no-op after the first start.\n- `server_config::Provisioned::from_parts` — builds provisioning state from persisted parts (a journaled Directory + already-recorded group events); `apply` already skips what exists, so a restart creates nothing.\n- `serve::start_server_config_persisted` — serve now starts the config from persisted state: accounts into the journaled directory (`directory.jsonl` beside the groups log, the world-directory layout), preformed group events into the serve groups log itself — the same state live serving folds and replays. `cmd_serve` calls the persisted start; `--server-config` absent = unchanged behavior, and the slice-1 in-memory `start_server_config` remains for its existing tests/callers.\n\n## Acceptance mapping (#5119)\n- Config-provisioned accounts and preformed group events are persisted/seeded into the state used by live serving: yes — directory journal + groups log.\n- A restart loads them without recreating them or reporting new creations: proven by `start_server_config_persisted_survives_a_restart` (second start reports `Report::default()`, accounts resolvable, events loaded back).\n- No-config behavior preserved: the persisted path only runs when `--server-config` is given.\n\n## Tests\n- New: `groups::log` test_record_preformed_seeds_once_and_then_skips; `commands::serve` start_server_config_persisted_survives_a_restart.\n- Targeted runs on the laptop: see the task note on #5119 for the exact commands and results.\n\n## Still remaining for #5119 (not this PR)\n- Wire config.freshness() into a real seitan admission check on the serve path.\n- Integration tests for member/non-member pulls + configured freshness through the live path.\n- #798 remainder / acceptance-brief handoff update.\n\nRefs #5119\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796947984&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8356&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8356&signature=1dde586ab0d53993367a56cde3fb189f3744817e3c7e4cdcd99bf2a8ef077455\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8356?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-11T00:13:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:24:20Z","closed_at":"2026-11-11T00:30:49Z","merged_at":"2026-11-11T00:30:49Z","merge_commit_sha":"63c58970fceed9842441cc518dfb75fccc91e50f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[{"id":7767549,"node_id":"T_kwDOAZNvF84AdoX9","url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549","members_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/2643